{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Ibn Majah","name_native":"Sunan Ibn Mâjah","section":{"32":"Chapters on Dress"},"section_detail":{"32":{"hadithnumber_first":3550,"hadithnumber_last":3656,"arabicnumber_first":3550,"arabicnumber_last":3656,"name_native":"Livre des vêtements"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":3629,"arabicnumber":3629,"text":"Rapporté par Humaid : On a demandé à Anas bin Malik : “Le Messager d’Allah (ﷺ) teignait-il ses cheveux ?” Il a répondu : “Il n’avait pas de cheveux blancs, sauf environ dix-sept ou vingt cheveux à l’avant de sa barbe.”","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":32,"hadith":80}}]}